# Input

```svelte
<div>above</div>
<script>
    const hi = '';
</script>
<div>below</div>

<div>
    <div>above</div>
    <script>
        const hi = '';
    </script>
    <div>below</div>
</div>

<div>
    <div>above</div>
    <script>
        const hi = '';
    </script>
    <style></style>
</div>

<!-- i stay above style -->


<style>
    .a {
        color: blue;
    }
</style>

```


